    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***Large Detached Family Home*** \n***2 Reception Rooms***\n\nHere at Byrne Malone Estate Agents, we are excited to present No. 109 Allenview Heights to the market for sale by private treaty. This charming and spacious four-bedroom detached home is ideally positioned on a corner site within a quiet, mature and highly sought after residential area of Newbridge. Beautifully upgraded by its current owners and presented in excellent condition throughout, this is a superb family home within walking distance of schools and all local amenities. Viewing is highly recommended. \n\nOn entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting hallway, finished with eye-catching black-and-white tiled flooring, creating an immediate sense of style and character. To the left, a generously proportioned sitting room features elegant wooden flooring, a striking feature fireplace with stove, and a large picture window that fills the room with natural light. To the right, double glass-panelled doors lead to a second reception room, complete with a charming red brick fireplace and stove, making it an ideal cosy TV room or family snug.\n\nThe heart of the home is the stylish kitchen/dining area, which offers excellent storage, a central island, and tiled flooring throughout, providing a practical yet contemporary space for everyday living and entertaining. Just off the kitchen is a large utility room with additional storage, while a rear door leads directly to the spacious rear garden, perfect for outdoor relaxation.\n\nFurther accommodation includes four bright and well-proportioned bedrooms, all finished with wooden flooring. The main bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes and a neatly tiled ensuite. A fully tiled, modern family bathroom completes the interior.\n\nExternally, the property boasts a large front garden with ample parking, along with a generous rear garden offering excellent outdoor space. Ideally located within walking distance of primary and secondary schools, shops, bars, restaurants and all local amenities, with Newbridge Train Station and the M7 motorway just a short drive away, this home offers the perfect blend of space, comfort and convenience.\n\nEarly viewing is strongly advised."
      },
